  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.3.0 adds Windows x64/x86 and .NET 8 ReadInt64/WriteInt64, target-width ReadPointer/WritePointer, and an executable coverage audit of 71 pinned native C APIs (69 direct calls, 2 documented command-line alternatives). It preserves all 2.2.1 Public API signatures, supported platforms and pinned libmem commit. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.3.0 为 Windows x64/x86 和 .NET 8 添加 64 位整数读写、目标进程位宽指针读写，以及对固定 native libmem 71 个 C API 的覆盖审计（69 个直接调用、2 个命令行托管替代）。保持 2.2.1 公共 API、支持平台和固定 native 版本不变。Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/docs/releases/v2.3.0.md",
